What this distribution contains (Apache-2.0 section 4b)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This work is original. Every file in this repository was written for this
project, and no source file of vosk-api is vendored, patched or copied into it.
The modified files, in the sense of section 4(b) of the License, are the whole
of this repository, because the upstream project is used as an installed
package rather than as source.

The Python package `vosk` is not part of this repository. It is installed from
PyPI and is the reference implementation of the speech recognition toolkit by
Alpha Cephei Inc, published from https://github.com/alphacep/vosk-api. The
binary build in this repository ships that package's native libraries inside the
folder next to the exe, and their notices are reproduced below as sections 4(c)
and 4(d) require.

